"""
AxisOS Task Manager (X-App Architecture)
========================================
Developed in Python 3 & GTK 3 following the Linux Mint X-Apps Design Philosophy.
Features:
- Traditional desktop layout: Classic MenuBar, Dedicated ToolBar, Multi-tab Notebook, StatusBar
- High-contrast Windows 11 Task Manager style telemetry with Cairo vector graphs:
  * CPU: Neon Mint (#87cf3e)
  * Memory: Electric Cyan (#00E5FF)
  * Disk: Emerald Green (#00E676)
  * Network: Amber Orange (#FFAB00)
- Process tree with PID, CPU %, Memory MB, User, and one-click End Task
- Systemd service diagnostics and Run New Task launcher
"""

